OL,3,GNEWSAHunt to find owner of #1m winning
OL,4,Alottery ticket
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hunt is on to find Tameside's next
OL,7,Fmillionaire.
OL,9,FThe owner of a lottery ticket bought in
OL,10,Fthe Greater Manchester borough this
OL,11,Fsummer now only has two months left to
OL,12,Fclaim their #1m prize.
OL,14,FUnder National Lottery rules, winners
OL,15,Fmust submit their claim within six
OL,16,Fmonths. In this case they must do so
OL,17,Fbefore 00:00 GMT on 28 December.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
